َحْسَنُ","N","stem","MS|NOM"]]},{"i":"4:59:28","a":"تَأْوِيلًا","t":"(for final) determination","p":"N","tr":"tawīlan","f":["VN","(II)","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":58,"l":579},{"e":"٥٩","v":"4:59"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"4:52","t":"Those are the ones whom Allāh has cursed; and he whom Allāh curses - never will you find for him a helper.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"4:53","t":"Or have they a share of dominion? Then [if that were so], they would not give the people [even as much as] the speck on a date seed.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"4:54","t":"Or do they envy people for what Allāh has given them of His bounty? But We had already given the family of Abraham the Scripture and wisdom and conferred upon them a great kingdom.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"4:55","t":"And some among them believed in it, and some among them were averse to it. And sufficient is Hell as a blaze.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"4:56","t":"Indeed, those who disbelieve in Our verses - We will drive them into a fire. Every time their skins are roasted through, We will replace them with other skins so they may taste the punishment. Indeed, Allāh is ever Exalted in Might and Wise.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"4:57","t":"But those who believe and do righteous deeds - We will admit them to gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they abide forever. For them therein are purified spouses, and We will admit them to deepening shade.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"4:58","t":"Indeed, Allāh commands you to render trusts to whom they are due and when you judge between people to judge with justice. Excellent is that which Allāh instructs you. Indeed, Allāh is ever Hearing and Seeing.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"4:59","t":"O you who have believed, obey Allāh and obey the Messenger and those in authority among you. And if you disagree over anything, refer it to Allāh and the Messenger, if you should believe in Allāh and the Last Day. That is the best [way] and best in result.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":59,"sd":null}],"juz":5,"hizb":9,"surahs":[4],"sajdah":false}